Fills the air around you with reactive currents of force.

If you have a gem or mindstar in your psionically wielded slot, this will do [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage to all adjacent enemies, costing 0.5 energy per creature.

If you have a conventional weapon in your psionically wielded slot, this will add [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Physical damage to all your weapon hits, costing 0.5 energy per hit.

When deactivated, if you have at least 6 energy, a massive spike of kinetic energy is released as a range 6 beam, smashing targets for up to [181, 244, 293, 334, 370 (TL1-5; MP 100)] physical damage and sending them flying.

'''Activating the aura takes no time but de-activating it does.'''

To turn off an aura without spiking it, deactivate it and target yourself. The damage will improve with your Mindpower.

You can only have two of these auras active at once.
